{"reviews":[{"id":"B0969X4GS3-0","r":5.0,"t":"They are good quality clips","x":"They are better of what I was expecting. Very happy.","h":11,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2020"},{"id":"B0969X4GS3-1","r":2.0,"t":"Clips don\u2019t hold up","x":"These clips were not sturdy at all. A couple of them were already broken upon arrival. I used these to make my own clip-in hair extensions. Some of the clips stopped opening after 1 use. Poor design of the clips but the needles and thread seem to be fine.","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2021"},{"id":"B0969X4GS3-2","r":1.0,"t":"All kinds of wrong","x":"The needles have no point you can't use them and they are too big for the included clips so you can't use them at all if you get lucky and find 1 sharp needle","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2022"},{"id":"B0969X4GS3-3","r":3.0,"t":"Thread too thin!","x":"The reason for the 3 stars, the thread is extremely thin. I mean EXTREMELY thin! Everything else was good!","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2020"},{"id":"B0969X4GS3-4","r":5.0,"t":"Works well for intended purpose!","x":"I did my friend's wedding a couple weeks ago & her bridesmaids just had babies & were in the stage where their hair was falling out. So we decided to give them a fuller look we would get extensions. The one they gave me to work with did not come with the clips already in. So I bought these & sewed them in myself & it looked great! Worked really well for its intended purpose. I'd purchase again!","h":2,"v":1,"d":"May 2021"},{"id":"B0969X4GS3-5","r":2.0,"t":"Not For Thin Fine Hair","x":"I like everything in this kit ... except the clips. These do not work for thin, fine hair. If you don't have a lot for it to grab onto, the rounded teeth simply don't work. They're probably fine if you have thicker hair, but if you don't I'd stick with the clips that have straight teeth. The needles, thread, pins and threader are great, though.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2022"},{"id":"B0969X4GS3-6","r":5.0,"t":"Great for DIY hair clip in extensions.","x":"I ordered this to make my clip in extensions and it was perfect. This was my first time making clip ins so the items in the box were helpful. When I was done I clipped them in my hair and had a mini dance party. They are pretty stable. I don't need to worry about then falling out!!!","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2022"},{"id":"B0969X4GS3-7","r":5.0,"t":"ALL IN ONE KIT","x":"Needed this kit so I could make a wig. It\u2019s so convenient that everything I needed came inside of it. The thread is strong and durable! The clips stay closed and secure! If you need these items then buy this kit it won\u2019t disappoint!!","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2022"},{"id":"B0969X4GS3-8","r":4.0,"t":"Good kit, good for fun hair add ins.","x":"Got any wigs that match your hair color, or if you just wanna have a few clips of fun colors in your hair, these are perfect! The needles arent my favorite since i have problems properly gripping the curved ones, so if you have one of those dollar tree sewing kits, you can use those instead.  This is a perfect kit for assembling a good amount of clip ins, so again, if theres any wigs you got that you dont wear anymore but still want some fun add ins for your hair, use the wefts from that. Just m","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2022"},{"id":"B0969X4GS3-9","r":4.0,"t":"Good for the purpose","x":"I originally brought this to sew wig clips in a wig from Amazon as well. Now, I use it to patch holes in my leggings. I seen a lot of comments about the thread being thin; I feel as if you wrapped more than once or twice; the thread is good. The wig needle does not fit in the wig clips holes so take that into consideration. Other than that, I'm satisfied","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2021"},{"id":"B0969X4GS3-10","r":3.0,"t":"Not like the bueaty supply store","x":"The needles are OK. The amount of clips this package comes with is great. BUT THE Thread is very thin like for clothes. It is not the weave thread.!!!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2021"},{"id":"B0969X4GS3-11","r":2.0,"t":"cheap quality","x":"Some of the clips would break as soon as you bend them to open . I don\u2019t think I would buy or even suggest this product .","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2022"},{"id":"B0969X4GS3-12","r":1.0,"t":"Mala calidad el hilo","x":"Todo perfecto menos el Hilo muy mala calidad cos\u00ed varias veces los clip y al segundo d\u00eda el hilo se rompi\u00f3","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2021"},{"id":"B0969X4GS3-13","r":2.0,"t":"Doesn\u2019t match description","x":"The thread color is suppose to be dark brown, instead it\u2019s more like a light reddish brown.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2021"},{"id":"B0969X4GS3-14","r":5.0,"t":"Happy with purchase","x":"I was happy to see what all was in the kit.  I haven't used it yet.  But I will soon.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B0969X4GS3-15","r":3.0,"t":"It's regular thread not weaving thread","x":"Disappointed. I needed hair weaving thread not this thin thread that was sent","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2022"},{"id":"B0969X4GS3-16","r":5.0,"t":"Little too small","x":"I like it but it\u2019s a little too small. I don\u2019t like that there\u2019s not enough material in front sides and back either. I may not have known any better but I bought the same item from another company that has the material. Still even that one needs to be a bit larger.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2022"},{"id":"B0969X4GS3-17","r":3.0,"t":"The thread \ud83e\uddf5 is a joke honestly","x":"I love everything about this but the thread! Baby the thread is not giving what it was supposed to give. It is thinner than regular garment sewing thread that you\u2019d find at the $1 store, it is trash. Everything else is suitable.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2021"},{"id":"B0969X4GS3-18","r":2.0,"t":"Wig Clips Snag Hair Bad","x":"This is a great combination of tools and great price. The wig clips hurt bad and snag and pull hair even if put in the most gentle way. They are not coated and not soft ball tips. Great value but clips need to be changed","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2023"},{"id":"B0969X4GS3-19","r":5.0,"t":"Has everything you need.","x":"Love the fact that the contents came in hard plastic locking case. Had the crazy idea to take shiny easter grass and make them into hair extensions. Suited my purposes and I received lots of compliments.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2021"},{"id":"B0969X4GS3-20","r":5.0,"t":"Great product!","x":"I loved this product bc I got everything I neeed to do my extensions from clip in extensions from see in extensions you choose!! And it\u2019s at a great price point at that! You can\u2019t beat this honestly!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2022"},{"id":"B0969X4GS3-21","r":4.0,"t":"Great for DIY Clip-Ins","x":"This is great for those who want to save money and create seamless clip-in extensions. These are great and durable. The shipping was easy and there were no damages to the product. I recommend this.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2023"},{"id":"B0969X4GS3-22","r":4.0,"t":"Work okay","x":"The clips and needles are okay, pretty standard. However, make sure that you purchase your own thread from the beauty supply store because the one provided isn\u2019t great, just regular, thin thread.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2021"},{"id":"B0969X4GS3-23","r":5.0,"t":"You get exactly what is advertised","x":"There was nothing i didnt like you recieve exactlywhat is shown and advertised i havent had a chance to utilize the product but when i do ill revise my comment and add pictures","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2021"},{"id":"B0969X4GS3-24","r":5.0,"t":"Great","x":"I love this kit easy to use. I love wearing clip ins hair extensions and some after a few uses the clips need some sewing and this come in handy.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2021"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Many reviewers find the clips flimsy or prone to breaking, with some arriving broken or failing after minimal use.","cites":[2,12]},{"text":"Several reviewers complain that the thread is extremely thin or of poor quality, sometimes breaking quickly.","cites":[4,11,13]},{"text":"Some reviewers report problems with the needles, such as being dull, too large for the clips, or hard to grip.","cites":[3,9,10]},{"text":"Multiple reviewers praise the kit as convenient and complete, with everything needed included and clips that stay secure.","cites":[5,7,8,15]},{"text":"A few reviewers note the clips don't work well for thin or fine hair.","cites":[6]}]},"qa":[]}